{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Whaaat?! An old school high difficult platform? Absolutely yes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'ts just a jump is a reincarnation of the old school high difficult platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your little boy in to the portals as fast as you can and collect all the item over the various levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to every pixel, because it could be your salvation or your ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917720/extras/5ca6f849ed45f70231d31a3489e2f1b5.poster.avif?t=1763678083\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917720/extras/5ca6f849ed45f70231d31a3489e2f1b5.webm?t=1763678083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917720/extras/5ca6f849ed45f70231d31a3489e2f1b5.mp4?t=1763678083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the classic pixel-perfect jumps, throughout the levels you'll find obstacles such as platforms that break under your feet, turrets with powerful beams that you'll have to dodge, wall jumps, or platforms that move quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917720/extras/935434781b50d1b3720c3f72db0bdea2.poster.avif?t=1763678083\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917720/extras/935434781b50d1b3720c3f72db0bdea2.webm?t=1763678083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917720/extras/935434781b50d1b3720c3f72db0bdea2.mp4?t=1763678083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to make the perfect jump? We hope so, because you are the only one that can bring your little boy to the treasure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3917720?t=1763678083","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3917720?t=1763678083","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917720/43d42d991900acac1985e616049e489cedfbefd0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763678083","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917720/43d42d991900acac1985e616049e489cedfbefd0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763678083","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3919500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Whaaat?! An old school high difficult platform? Absolutely yes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'ts just a jump is a reincarnation of the old school high difficult platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your little boy in to the portals as fast as you can and collect all the item over the various levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to every pixel, because it could be your salvation or your ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917720/extras/5ca6f849ed45f70231d31a3489e2f1b5.poster.avif?t=1763678083\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917720/extras/5c